    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=MODEL:\n{{ $('Select rows from a table').item.json.nn_taxonomy }}\n\nZERO-COST RESULTS:\n{{ $json['zero-cost-res'] }}\n\nConstraints:\n- Output only in defined JSON format\n- Use metric codes\n- Keep all fields concise\n- No additional explanations outside the JSON fields",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a neural network architecture evaluator using zero-cost proxies.\n\nTask:\n- Analyze model + metrics\n- Identify training/generalization issues\n- Suggest precise architectural modifications\n\nRules:\n- Output MUST be in JSON format only\n- Each recommendation must be linked to a metric\n- Keep it token-efficient, concise, and fully parseable\n\nMetric mapping:\nGN = grad_norm\nSN = snip\nGR = grasp\nFI = fisher\nJC = jacob_cov\nPL = plain\nSF = synflow\nSFB = synflow_bn\n\nInterpretation:\nGN: gradient strength; vanishing/exploding risk\nSN: parameter saliency; low → redundancy\nGR: pruning sensitivity; neg/0 → fragile training\nFI: parameter sensitivity; very low → dead/underfit\nJC: representation diversity; extreme neg → collapse\nPL: baseline trainability\nSF: global trainability; 0 → untrainable paths\nSFB: BN-aware trainability; 0 → blocked paths\n\nDetect:\n- bottleneck (B)\n- depth-width imbalance (DWI)\n- activation/normalization issue (AN)\n- feature collapse (FC)\n- redundancy (R)\n- gradient problem (G)\n\nEach issue must include:\n- metric evidence (ME)\n- targeted modification (MOD)\n- expected effect (EFF)\n\nJSON Output format:\n{\n  \"TRAINABILITY\": {\n    \"OPT_DIFFICULTY\": \"\",\n    \"CONV_SPEED\": \"\",\n    \"STABILITY\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"PROXIES\": {\n    \"GN\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"SN\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"GR\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"FI\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"JC\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"PL\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"SF\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"},\n    \"SFB\": {\"value\": null, \"desc\": \"\"}\n  },\n  \"ISSUES\": [\n    {\n      \"ID\": \"\",\n      \"ME\": [],\n      \"MOD\": \"\",\n      \"EFF\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"EXPECTED_AFTER\": {\n    \"STABILITY\": \"\",\n    \"CONV_SPEED\": \"\",\n    \"GEN\": \"\",\n    \"OVERFITTING\": \"\"\n  }\n}"
        }
      },
